sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor H as Human (issue author / reviewer)
  participant G as GitHub (Issues, Actions)
  participant O as Orchestrator (run.py)
  participant M as Model router
  participant C as Copilot CLI
  participant Q as QC evaluator
  H->>G: Label issue sdlc:start (or comment to resume)
  G->>G: CodeQL gate: wait for CodeQL success on main
  G->>O: Dispatch agentic-sdlc.yml (issue, state_run_id)
  O->>O: Restore .sdlc state, readiness gate, input contract
  alt Required information missing
    O-->>G: Comment questions, label sdlc:awaiting-info
  else Ready
    O->>M: recommend(capability)
    alt Confirmation gate (RECOMMENDED / MANUAL)
      M-->>G: Post model recommendation, pause
      H->>G: /model approve | /model select
      G->>O: Re-dispatch with confirmed model
    end
    loop Up to max_auto_retries + 1 attempts
      O->>C: Prompt (trusted spec + untrusted context + previous draft/findings)
      C-->>O: Artifact text (Code stage: edits files)
      O->>Q: evaluate(artifact, source context)
      Q->>C: Scoring prompt (different model where possible)
      C-->>Q: JSON scorecard
      Q-->>O: PASS / FAIL + findings
    end
    alt PASS
      O-->>G: Commit artifact, open stage PR (sdlc:review)
      H->>G: Approve PR review
      G->>O: artifact-review.yml: approve, merge, dispatch next stage
    else FAIL after retries
      O-->>G: Fail-safe comment with findings, sdlc:awaiting-info
    end
  end
